**Considering file management options**

I'm thinking about options for managing files, like duplicating, deleting, or moving images and non-media files. I notice that there shouldn’t be any preview for non-media files. Also, I wonder if I should always show more menu items when options go beyond just "copy." It's important to keep the user experience clear and efficient, so knowing how to handle these menus well is essential!
