I’m looking at the tooltip tests for an image and noticing a contradiction. The localized tooltip test expects various actions, while an earlier test seems to contradict this by requiring none. It seems `find.byTooltip` is used to find Tooltip widgets. There might be some confusion with how media actions are structured. I’m wondering if the test is failing due to outdated conditions or whether different toolbars are being used for images. I’ll investigate how the image is rendered in the code.
