I see that I don’t need to apply constraints for the button! The existing object applies them incorrectly for the menu, but that might not be a problem. If I set code constraints for maxHeight, then it affects the button size instead of the menu. It seems that I should use style for button size. Maybe I need a PopupMenuButton style? But if there’s no child, it defaults to an IconButton with its constraints. Let’s keep going!
